The full exact run is still computing. Since the task has a hard audit shape, I’m not going to infer emptiness from the earlier fixed-face kill; this stratum needs either the full saturated basis or an explicitly typed gap.
diff --git a/box/strata-gate-20260903/strata_gate.py b/box/strata-gate-20260903/strata_gate.py
