+| `[2,2]` | `y^11*(y-x)^2*(y-a2*x)^2` | 45 | 100 | `c*a2*(a2-1)` | `SATURATED-EMPTY`, basis `1`, 0.025 s |
+
+**MEASURED.** All five replayed exact scripts passed the empty and nonempty
