+| `(45,30;42;11;k=1)` | `[3,1]` | 45 | 100 | 208.834 s | `SATURATED-EMPTY`, basis `1`, 0.015 s | `true` |
+
+**DERIVED.** Since the listed partitions are exactly the Prop. 4.6 cap cover
