+| `[1,1]` | `y^5*(y-x)*(y-a2*x)` | 17 | 32 | `c*a2*(a2-1)` | `SATURATED-EMPTY`, basis `1`, 0.016 s |
+
+**DERIVED.** The earlier fixed face `y^5(y^2-x^2)` was an unlicensed numeric
